---
description: Content model, IDs, kinds, and relationships
globs: content/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `docs/CONTENT-MODEL.md`. Canonical examples are listed there.

- IDs are `gg:<kind>:<kebab-slug>` and immutable.
- Author only `related` and optional `prerequisites`.
- Parent/children come from the filesystem.
- `person` is allowed in the schema but not required in the seed.
